-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §23: a permanent teacher moved from the
-- junior-high week to the primary week by the Ministry's demand or the
-- closing of the school works the primary week and is owed a personal
-- supplement of 12.5% of the combined salary times the junior-high share of
-- the position on the eve of the move; the State works for its recognition
-- in the budgetary pension, and pension and study-fund contributions are
-- made on it.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

§ `23`

-- akn:art_23 The clause's heading line ("מורה שעבר מהעסקה לפי מבנה שבוע עבודה של חטיבת ביניים…"); its rules are (א)–(ג).

DECLARE `cause of the move` IS ONE OF
    `the Ministry's demand`
    `the closing of the school`
    `another cause`

@desc A teacher moved from the junior-high week to the primary week, as far as §23 asks.
DECLARE `moved teacher` HAS
    `permanent`                                IS A BOOLEAN
    `was on the reform's junior-high week`     IS A BOOLEAN
    cause                                      IS A `cause of the move`
    `junior-high position fraction on the eve of the move` IS A NUMBER
    `combined salary`                          IS A NUMBER @desc the teacher's combined salary (שכר משולב); from the tables of §35, an input

@ref akn:art_23__para_a
GIVEN t IS A `moved teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `entitled to the section 23 supplement` t IF
        t's `permanent`
    AND t's `was on the reform's junior-high week`
    AND NOT t's cause EQUALS `another cause`

`the section 23 rate` MEANS 12.5%

-- No rounding is stated (convention rounding.default).
GIVEN t IS A `moved teacher`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the section 23 personal supplement` t IS
    IF `entitled to the section 23 supplement` t
    THEN `the section 23 rate` TIMES t's `combined salary` TIMES t's `junior-high position fraction on the eve of the move`
    ELSE 0

DECLARE `section 23 action` IS ONE OF
    `act to have the supplement recognised as permanent for the pension law`
    `make accrual-pension contributions on the supplement`
    `make study-fund contributions on the supplement`

-- (ב): the State acts for recognition as a permanent supplement under the
-- State Service (Pensions) Law; for one insured in an accrual pension,
-- contributions are made on it. (ג): study-fund contributions are made on
-- it.
@ref akn:art_23__para_b
GIVEN `insured in an accrual pension` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `section 23 action`
DECIDE `the pension on the section 23 supplement` `insured in an accrual pension` IS
    IF `insured in an accrual pension`
    THEN PARTY `the State` MUST `make accrual-pension contributions on the supplement`
         LEST BREACH BY `the State` BECAUSE "section 23(ב): accrual-pension contributions on the supplement"
    ELSE PARTY `the State` MUST `act to have the supplement recognised as permanent for the pension law`
         LEST BREACH BY `the State` BECAUSE "section 23(ב): the State acts for the supplement's recognition"

@ref akn:art_23__para_c
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `section 23 action`
DECIDE `the study fund on the section 23 supplement` IS
    PARTY `the State` MUST `make study-fund contributions on the supplement`
    LEST BREACH BY `the State` BECAUSE "section 23(ג): study-fund contributions on the supplement"

-- A teacher wholly in the junior high school, closed down, on a combined
-- salary of 8,000 (a placeholder): 12.5% of 8,000 = 1,000.
`a teacher moved when the school closed` MEANS
    `moved teacher` WITH
        `permanent`                                IS TRUE
        `was on the reform's junior-high week`     IS TRUE
        cause                                      IS `the closing of the school`
        `junior-high position fraction on the eve of the move` IS 1
        `combined salary`                          IS 8000

#ASSERT `the section 23 personal supplement` `a teacher moved when the school closed` EQUALS 1000

`a teacher who moved by choice` MEANS
    `moved teacher` WITH
        `permanent`                                IS TRUE
        `was on the reform's junior-high week`     IS TRUE
        cause                                      IS `another cause`
        `junior-high position fraction on the eve of the move` IS 0.5
        `combined salary`                          IS 8000

#ASSERT `the section 23 personal supplement` `a teacher who moved by choice` EQUALS 0

#TRACE `the study fund on the section 23 supplement` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the State` DOES `make study-fund contributions on the supplement` AT 30
